\citation{mitchell2019modelcards}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The FLAIR federated-evaluation workflow. \emph  {Centralized governance} (top): a Model Owner builds and freezes an artifact against public MIMIC-CLIF; the Benchmark Committee reviews it and stamps an audit hash; the FLAIR Portal registers and distributes byte-identical code and the frozen model. \emph  {At each participating site} (bottom): the local EHR in CLIF feeds task build (cohort and labeling logic), prediction rows (one row per opportunity with point-in-time features), the frozen baseline (inference only), per-stay risk scores, evaluation (episodic, landmark, or peak metrics), and cell suppression (cohort counts below 10 suppressed), producing an aggregate report of metrics, code registry, and audit metadata. Only aggregate, cell-suppressed reports return to the FLAIR Report and Leaderboard (per-site AUROC panels); no patient-level rows leave any site, and sites approve what runs locally. Source: authors.}}{8}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:workflow}{{1}{8}{The FLAIR federated-evaluation workflow. \emph {Centralized governance} (top): a Model Owner builds and freezes an artifact against public MIMIC-CLIF; the Benchmark Committee reviews it and stamps an audit hash; the FLAIR Portal registers and distributes byte-identical code and the frozen model. \emph {At each participating site} (bottom): the local EHR in CLIF feeds task build (cohort and labeling logic), prediction rows (one row per opportunity with point-in-time features), the frozen baseline (inference only), per-stay risk scores, evaluation (episodic, landmark, or peak metrics), and cell suppression (cohort counts below 10 suppressed), producing an aggregate report of metrics, code registry, and audit metadata. Only aggregate, cell-suppressed reports return to the FLAIR Report and Leaderboard (per-site AUROC panels); no patient-level rows leave any site, and sites approve what runs locally. Source: authors}{figure.1}{}}
