\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Per-site discrimination of the frozen baseline across the CLIF consortium, one panel per task. Each marker is a site's AUROC with a 95\% confidence interval; the dashed line is the MIMIC-CLIF internal reference and the shaded band marks worse-than-chance discrimination. The four observed sites (MIMIC-CLIF, Rush, Northwestern Medicine, University of Chicago Medicine) are shown in colour; four onboarding consortium sites appear as greyed placeholder rows pending federated runs. Landmark tasks (T1, T2) use the pooled dynamic AUC. Source: FLAIR baseline report artifacts, single-sourced through \texttt  {flair\_paper\_data.py}.}}{11}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:forest}{{3}{11}{Per-site discrimination of the frozen baseline across the CLIF consortium, one panel per task. Each marker is a site's AUROC with a 95\% confidence interval; the dashed line is the MIMIC-CLIF internal reference and the shaded band marks worse-than-chance discrimination. The four observed sites (MIMIC-CLIF, Rush, Northwestern Medicine, University of Chicago Medicine) are shown in colour; four onboarding consortium sites appear as greyed placeholder rows pending federated runs. Landmark tasks (T1, T2) use the pooled dynamic AUC. Source: FLAIR baseline report artifacts, single-sourced through \texttt {flair\_paper\_data.py}}{figure.3}{}}
